BT 0.063 0.165 0.263 rg /F2 14.00 Tf 48.00 298.00 Td (Common Mistakes) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.50 Tf 48.00 273.00 Td (1. Saying BCC has close-packed planes.) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.00 Tf 66.00 254.00 Td (More accurate: BCC has no true close-packed plane. Its densest planes are {110},) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.00 Tf 66.00 241.00 Td (  and its closest-packed directions are <111>.) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.50 Tf 48.00 223.00 Td (2. Saying FCC and HCP are completely different in packing efficiency.) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.00 Tf 66.00 204.00 Td (More accurate: FCC and HCP both have APF = 0.74 and coordination number 12. Their) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.00 Tf 66.00 191.00 Td (  main difference is stacking sequence.) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.50 Tf 48.00 173.00 Td (3. Treating rock salt as if it were a one-atom FCC metal.) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.00 Tf 66.00 154.00 Td (More accurate: Rock salt is an ionic structure with two ion types. It has) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.00 Tf 66.00 141.00 Td (  octahedral coordination, 6:6 coordination, and 4 formula units per cubic unit) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.00 Tf 66.00 128.00 Td (  cell.) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.50 Tf 48.00 110.00 Td (4. Confusing coordination number with number of atoms per unit cell.) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.00 Tf 66.00 91.00 Td (Example: FCC has 4 atoms per conventional unit cell, but each atom has 12 nearest) Tj ET
BT 0.122 0.161 0.200 rg /F1 10.00 Tf 66.00 78.00 Td (  neighbors.) Tj ET
